  triage:title "peer_drain_coordinator.rs drain() multi-page pagination/retry loop has zero test coverage" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/peer_drain_coordinator.rs:277 -- the real multi-page pagination/retry loop in drain() has zero test coverage for >1 page or mid-page partial-failure; every test that sets max_batch_messages uses either 1 or sends only a single message. Fresh, independently-discovered gap in the same functional area as RSH-003/RSH-004, but a distinct concern (missing coverage, not incorrect logic). Fix already in progress under AICH-PEER-DRAIN-RETRY-1 (fix/phase-ai-peer-drain-partial-retry) dispatched to arch-ctm." ;
